    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300520/extras/bd34104c4718424e5b7caeab7938abb4.poster.avif?t=1715976045\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300520/extras/bd34104c4718424e5b7caeab7938abb4.apng?t=1715976045\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infernal Elements</h2><br>In a desolate underground world ruled by The Elementals, a new being of fire is born.<br><br>Take control of the newest Fire Elemental on a mission to find their place and confront their predecessor.  Team up with an unlikely ally, The Water Elemental, on a mission to escape the underground which you are vital for. Work together as you go through a series of boss fights each tougher than the last.<br><br>This bullet-hell boss rush game will test your patience as you prove to them all how capable you are.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Top-down bullet-hell based gameplay<br></li><li> Multiple boss fights based around elements<br></li><li> Each fight with their own unique twist<br></li><li> An overarching story revolving around The Fire Elemental's journey</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300520/extras/bd34104c4718424e5b7caeab7938abb4.poster.avif?t=1715976045\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300520/extras/bd34104c4718424e5b7caeab7938abb4.apng?t=1715976045\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infernal Elements</h2><br>In a desolate underground world ruled by The Elementals, a new being of fire is born.<br><br>Take control of the newest Fire Elemental on a mission to find their place and confront their predecessor.  Team up with an unlikely ally, The Water Elemental, on a mission to escape the underground which you are vital for. Work together as you go through a series of boss fights each tougher than the last.<br><br>This bullet-hell boss rush game will test your patience as you prove to them all how capable you are.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Top-down bullet-hell based gameplay<br></li><li> Multiple boss fights based around elements<br></li><li> Each fight with their own unique twist<br></li><li> An overarching story revolving around The Fire Elemental's journey</li></ul>",
